<li><b>Decide:</b> <kbd>J</kbd> apply / confirm · <kbd>N</kbd> is right / revert · <kbd>E</kbd> edit · <kbd>X</kbd> strike · <kbd>U</kbd> unsure · <kbd>↑</kbd> <kbd>↓</kbd> card · <kbd>Z</kbd> undo.</li>
